  "definition": "Affordable Housing Project",
  "effectiveDate": "2020-09-14",
  "historyNote": "#2050, eff 6-13-82; ss by #2912, eff 11-26-84; EXPIRED 11-26-90 New. INTERIM #5921, eff 11-7-94, EXPIRED 3-7-95 New. #7424, eff 1-12-01; ss by #9353, INTERIM, eff 1-12-09, EXPIRED: 7-11-09 New. #9515, eff 7-18-09; ss by #9998, eff 9-20-11; ss by #10502, INTERIM, eff 1-3-14, EXPIRED: 7-2-14 New. #10757, eff 1-8-15; ss by #13080, eff 9-14-20",
